7356, "timestamp_updated": 1634317356, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "101095342", "author": {"steamid": "76561198394043119", "personaname": "24点黑杰克LV", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198394043119/", "num_games_owned": 98, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 1260, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 874, "last_played": 1761234761, "avatar": "cc5540397a635387c4598fdf278a45217f942158"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "玩法，内容，画质，全方位大改变，玩起真的很爽", "timestamp_created": 1634317334, "timestamp_updated": 1634317334, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "101095251", "author": {"steamid": "76561198842671422", "personaname": "诛影", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/822000/", "num_games_owned": 138, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 4715, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 983, "last_played": 1774243786, "avatar": "c11e0b3e06458a807a7bd11f186df762b407a449"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "总体可玩性还可以吧，主要是战役的bot跟犯病一样你被定了不来救，随时卡墙角抽搐，还不会自己买更好的武器，接管bot和中途进来的人跟nm坐牢一样，地图重复使用也太多了除了任务目标变了都没什么变化，建议后续优化一下bot，多出点新图", "timestamp_created": 1634317211, "timestamp_updated": 1634317211, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "101095117", "author": {"steamid": "76561198143741461", "personaname": "与珊为伴", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/1745665589/", "num_games_owned": 658, "num_reviews": 113, "playtime_forever": 3177, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 671, "last_played": 1719327541, "avatar": "8c45e7270c76c40060e4c80a35b0d5a8e2b3f094"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "价格是真的高了.\n\n配件能装不能拆 除非正好有你准备换的枪正好地上有多余的和你想拆的同类型的配件正好联机的队友都没注意到你正好想换的枪又比你拿着的品质高,你才能带着配件换新枪.\n\n画质是真的一言难尽.AMD那玩应关了以后完全没法看.\n\n音效经常莫名其妙中断 就像是有个人在你旁边不停按游戏静音键一样.还是随机性触发,有时候一点问题都没有.\n\n目前服务器是真的烂,比之beta期间没有丝毫进步.卡顿 丢帧 loss不稳定.\n\n卡牌一套一套解锁,这个没什么问题,但这几套卡牌优先解锁哪套能不能让玩家自己选? 枪也不能存 卡牌也不能速开 真就逼着玩家刷刷乐呗? 我寻思你刷刷乐也不能存通关后的毕业武器啊? 光一个卡牌进度 真能吸引人有动力刷下去吗?\n\nAI比之L4D系列就进步了个会丢雷 会标记 \n寻路系统反而比L4D系列差劲得多得多得多得多得多.这到底是技术进步还是退步?\n\n综上所述,在我个人看来,这定价是真的过了. 终极版150撑死了.\n\n\n2023年1月30日 01:00:47\n配件依旧不能拆 尼玛!", "timestamp_created": 1634317041, "timestamp_updated": 1675011664, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.441549032926559448", "comment_count": 2, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "101094888", "author": {"steamid": "76561198305586660", "personaname": "商鞅识马力", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198305586660/", "num_games_owned": 128, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 1925, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 655, "last_played": 1733672229, "avatar": "d7b7988e7bc32f8e08ab167acd110bf8783e59af"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "和朋友一起玩的，僵尸很热情，以前l4d的味道只增不减", "timestamp_created": 1634316736, "timestamp_updated": 1634316736, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.503419101238250732", "comment_count": 0,