ona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198344727232/", "num_games_owned": 166, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 1810, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 473, "last_played": 1755355192, "avatar": "618bfa7e8477cee17e56637af632fef4e31724b2"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "游戏性不错，但是有几个问题\n1.战役内玩家无法定义枪械配件的替换（这很难受）\n2.有些开牌手快拿了没办法拿掉（整个章节都要用，超级难受，特别指瞄具禁用）\n3.第三章开始流程出奇的短（剧情），不知道刻意为之还是制作时间的问题\n基于以上几点我给这个游戏评分的话   7/10分\n及格线过一点点主要是队友一起玩开心，但是游戏细节还需要打磨一下", "timestamp_created": 1634313114, "timestamp_updated": 1634313114, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "101091827", "author": {"steamid": "76561199019472505", "personaname": "轩岚", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199019472505/", "num_games_owned": 120, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 2771, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 272, "last_played": 1688941863, "avatar": "d3e8806bf9f1e2a08c944dc42fef4d4feafa66fd"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "除了枪的配件不能继承之外，其他的都还好。不错，挺好玩的。", "timestamp_created": 1634312800, "timestamp_updated": 1634312800, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}]}